  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60775170), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9D%B4%EB%8B%AC%EC%9D%98-%EB%82%A8%EC%9E%90/3220)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/154923)\n\nI am Lee Do-yeon. Now that I'm 30, I no longer enjoy snowing. It just makes the commute to work a little more difficult. I thought I would master all my emotions by the time I turned 30. Don’t be swayed by personal feelings, stay cool! But I was also a person who felt excited.\n\nThe cafe I went to every day,\n\n•The independent bookstore I visited,\n\nA difficult start to fitness,\n\nEven street pubs...! I just want to be cool, but men keep shaking my emotions.\n\nAppears.\n\nWill I ever be able to love someone completely with a pure heart again? Will that day ever come?",
